{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再反复盘算该收住还是放开，仿佛选对了就能不受伤。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复盘算\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想让对方按自己的心意靠近，不愿为了缓解难受就把期待全压给对方，催他回应。\",\n      \"key\": \"按自己的心意\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"text\": \"还没等到答案，小心靠近、不求确认地付出、独自珍藏、尽情欢喜都曾让他真切地快乐，也让他舍不得放下这个人。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得放下\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"以后若等不到对方主动靠近，他仍会疼，却不会因此认定先前的喜欢是假的。\",\n      \"key\": \"先前的喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍想被这个人选择，也愿继续喜欢、尽情享受欢喜，不再因怕改变关系就收回心意，也不靠克制证明自己清醒。\",\n      \"key\": \"尽情享受欢喜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"合并寻找无风险爱法与反复权衡的重复意思，用他仿佛只要选对就能避免受伤的具体念头呈现转变，并由前段两种做法都无法保证回应提供前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R67\", \"R72\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-2\", \"S14-4\", \"S14-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不以难受催促对方、不因对方未回应否定真心、不靠克制证明清醒分别放进相关条目，避免重复原则和整齐的否定清单。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R70\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并补全\",\n      \"why\": \"完整保留小心靠近、不求确认地付出、独自珍藏、尽情欢喜四种方式带来的真实快乐，并说明这些经历让他舍不得放下这个人，不再只是重复概括它们没有白费。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R71\", \"R73\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-4\", \"S14-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"将未来可能等不到主动靠近时的疼痛，与仍想被选择、继续喜欢并尽情享受欢喜的主动选择分开，保留风险仍在和继续投入的方向，避免反复宣布渴望。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4240f93c-56e7-4d09-b87f-faa956a13b6e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191310230224Z", "elapsed_seconds": 394.843, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:19:45.077238+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c8585eefb47e5447af6d1a0eccc6d6e8ad32486fea481fe6f3fc69c7bd87a159", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "aut